message: "If you use these datasets in an article or study, please cite them as below."
title: "Synthetic UK financial-services study datasets"
abstract: >-
  Six synthetic datasets for testing and illustrating AI in UK banking, insurance and finance:
  procurement fraud, regulatory reporting, AML transaction monitoring, insurance claims, SME lending
  and treasury liquidity. Each has about 100 primary records, business rules, planted cases with an
  answer key, and test questions. All people, firms and accounts are fictional.
type: dataset
